title: "PyHost-Context: single-key perturbation study of terminal-environment assumptions in Python test suites"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chen
    given-names: Junjie
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-3499-3621"
    affiliation: "School of Computer Science and Engineering, Nanjing University of Science and Technology"
