date-released: "2026-10-20"
version: "0.1.0"
keywords:
  - flaky tests
  - test environment
  - terminal rendering
  - Python
  - empirical software engineering
abstract: >-
  Code, protocols and evidence metadata for a study of how terminal-environment keys
  (COLUMNS, TERM and NO_COLOR) can change Python test outcomes, using committed
  single-key perturbation, A1-B-A2 recovery blocks and an E0-E4 evidence ladder.
